# Licensed agency DTDs — never committed.
# These files are dropped into this directory by a maintainer during the
# acquisition workflow documented in docs/runbooks/ectd-dtd-vendoring.md.
# Everything else in this directory (README.md, checksums.txt, fixtures/,
# this .gitignore) IS committed.
*.dtd

# Allow nothing else automatically — explicit "do not ignore" entries here
# keep the policy honest if a future *.dtd-adjacent file is introduced.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!checksums.txt
!fixtures/
!fixtures/**
